text = "OBJECTIVE
- Survive and obtain the highest score possible by shooting enemies. 

GAMEPLAY
- Kill 3 enemies in a row without taking damage to start a combo-chain multiplier.
- Taking damage, or letting the timer run out, breaks your combo back to normal.
- You have 4 lives, killing the green enemy gives you 1 life back.
- Avoid the asteroids!
- Boosting grants immunity.
- Shoot the power-up bubbles to obtain its powers!

Good luck :)

"

